th><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> so it is a cubic.</p>\n<p>Therefore, the polynomial is a cubic monomial.</p>\n</div></div>",
